{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T15:52:49.533Z","ordinal":48019,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-56576acc-3e69-47b1-80aa-22d1b3d7252b","process_id":"59182","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nx=json.load(open('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-docs-connection.json'))\nfor k,v in x.items():\n print(k, json.dumps(v)[:900])\nx=json.load(open('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json'))\nprint('TASKROOT',list(x))\nfor t in x.get('tasks',[]):\n if t['id']=='CSF-T005':print('TASKSTATUS',t['status'],t.get('evidence',[]))\nPY"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nx=json.load(open('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-docs-connection.json'))\nfor k,v in x.items():\n print(k, json.dumps(v)[:900])\nx=json.load(open('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json'))\nprint('TASKROOT',list(x))\nfor t in x.get('tasks',[]):\n if t['id']=='CSF-T005':print('TASKSTATUS',t['status'],t.get('evidence',[]))\nPY"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"schemaVersion 1\ndocumentType \"bounded-proof-receipt\"\nlifecycle \"evidence\"\nauthority \"supporting\"\nowner \"taxkit-api-sdk-owner\"\nobservedAt \"2026-10-06T14:44:30Z\"\nstatus \"Local native documentation connection qualified; whole T005 remains in progress\"\nbaseHead \"103feda047566d0941dc974784adf38eeaf9d68a\"\nactorAuthority {\"principal\": \"Cooper\", \"reviewer\": \"Codex\", \"operation\": \"Approved CSF-T005 implementation, local tests, commits, pushes and continuation of draft PR 155\", \"environment\": \"Compiled local Node and built native workerd/Chromium API/Website pair\", \"approvalBoundary\": \"No merge, registry publication, deployment or provider apply\"}\noutcome [\"Four named native documentation procedures use a separate DocsRpcGroup and DocsRpcClient with revision 1. The combined server supplies thirteen procedures; the nine calculator contracts and their revision 4 are preserved.\", \"The content owner supplies a bounded canonical public-page address and fixed public missing-page/search errors to both HTTP and RPC. Existing HTTP error exports, status/media behaviour and messages remain; generated OpenAPI records the same canonical page-path bound on replies.\", \"Each native documentation operation owns its receive-loop scope, a ten-second headers-and-body deadline and the existing two-MiB reply-byte limit. Credentials are omitted, redirects rejected, RPC and HTTP tracing disabled.\", \"Only native reply-decoding defects become DocsRpcInvalidResponse. An independent HTTP-adapter SchemaError retains exact defect identity. Expected source errors becom\nimpact {\"changeRequired\": [\"Shared public-page Schema and safe-error owner; HTTP canonical reuse/OpenAPI\", \"Four named documentation RPC contracts, separate closed live/test clients, combined server and shared bounded byte adapter\", \"Exact lint decoder/contract/class-factory selectors and twelve positive/negative actual-command fixture cases\", \"RPC dependency/export closure, private package/content major and HTTP patch Changeset\", \"API/Website/content/RPC/HTTP READMEs, API/content/frontend/package/Effect/testing architecture, active task/plan and bounded receipt\"], \"preserve\": [\"All 61 accepted authored page bytes, navigation, all 64 historical review records and 62 active review bindings\", \"All four original integration templates, tax algorithms and retained expected results\", \"Nine calculator procedures/revision, native admission/work/rate policy and fixed safe failure behaviour\", \"Historical\npriorFailureAndRecovery [\"Old calculator server fixtures initially lacked the ContentService now required by the combined server; they supply the owning checked controlled catalogue. Actual package output needed rebuilding after shared error ownership changed.\", \"Native protocol fixtures initially used the wrong URL prefix and tracing context; they now use the installed native protocol contract and explicit tracing-disabled service. A tap callback now returns an Effect.\", \"Focused lint rejected unsorted keys, direct collection indexing, wire-fixture encoding and tagged-error factory syntax outside the admitted paths. Narrow exact-file decoder/contract/egress/factory permissions now mirror the actual operations; neighbouring paths and Effect runners remain rejected.\", \"An automatic lint correction incorrectly changed new tagged-error class definitions. The source was corrected and exact factory exemptions added;\nfocusedChecks [{\"stage\": \"format\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"format\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.6, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-content-rpc-focus-n-format.log\"}, {\"stage\": \"rpc-types\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"--filter=@taxkit/api-rpc\", \"check-types\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.29, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-content-rpc-focus-n-rpc-types.log\"}, {\"stage\": \"rpc-tests\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"--filter=@taxkit/api-rpc\", \"test\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 1.09, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-content-rpc-focus-n-rpc-tests.log\"}, {\"stage\": \"lint\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"lint\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 5.96, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-content-rpc-focus-n-lint.log\"}, {\"stage\": \"native-pair\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"web:test:native-pair\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 96.15, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-content-rpc-focus-n-native-pair.log\"}, {\"stage\": \"format\", \nfullQualification {\"status\": \"Passed\", \"checks\": [{\"stage\": \"all-tests\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"test\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 95.83, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-content-rpc-full-a-all-tests.log\"}, {\"stage\": \"verification\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"verification\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 628.61, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-content-rpc-full-a-verification.log\"}, {\"stage\": \"compiled-node\", \"command\": [\"node\", \"/private/tmp/dev76-content-rpc-compiled-node-probe.mjs\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.22, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-content-rpc-full-a-compiled-node.log\"}], \"sourceIdentities\": [{\"path\": \".changeset/native-docs-content-connection.md\", \"sha256\": \"e73fdfb8ae5b9fb0f611675f4a8f12633d22e245e9e7a6feb2bdeadb6309a8b5\", \"bytes\": 580}, {\"path\": \"apps/api/README.md\", \"sha256\": \"cea7bc9d7f189218740deaf00e70b8b76a5dd062d95b75ffa27cabe504d372e3\", \"bytes\": 17106}, {\"path\": \"apps/web\nsourceIdentities [{\"path\": \".changeset/native-docs-content-connection.md\", \"sha256\": \"e73fdfb8ae5b9fb0f611675f4a8f12633d22e245e9e7a6feb2bdeadb6309a8b5\", \"bytes\": 580}, {\"path\": \"apps/api/README.md\", \"sha256\": \"cea7bc9d7f189218740deaf00e70b8b76a5dd062d95b75ffa27cabe504d372e3\", \"bytes\": 17106}, {\"path\": \"apps/web/README.md\", \"sha256\": \"b4af5c249c8fe50752a929b11dde801ece2df600e31499a463877665e826ba9c\", \"bytes\": 18483}, {\"path\": \"apps/web/test/native-pair.boundary.test.ts\", \"sha256\": \"3ce9a5a25371e5c19b09afaee56c47cccafa4b66bce0935805b1eba39c49c15e\", \"bytes\": 53035}, {\"path\": \"bun.lock\", \"sha256\": \"7c1c6a353f1cacd9e464e8447021f608cb71b91c065931a811c9260a1f89d1f7\", \"bytes\": 286497}, {\"path\": \"docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md\", \"sha256\": \"016271bfba563bf69ecb20a20343441147f24eb9165c04ffa7951c6fe501a2b3\", \"bytes\": 30798}, {\"path\": \"docs/architecture/content-and-posts.md\", \"sha256\": \"b264462bf42cc1af8ede3c21b9fc\ncompiledNodeProof {\"node\": \"v24.16.0\", \"calculatorProcedures\": 9, \"documentationProcedures\": 4, \"catalogueSha256\": \"6f3d3beb055c2d5d83ba5abeb9feef3fb8da51188f077e9181685f8f708c26b