e backend. Generated static assets need no extra server. No raw MDX or alternate calculations. |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:444:search alone does not establish their identity. Each correction must reject\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:542:Source research confirms Site declares the retained datasets `site-prod-logs`,\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:576:| Named spans | `taxkit.calculate`, `taxkit.catalog`, `taxkit.content.read`, `taxkit.search`, `taxkit.mcp.call` as applicable | Actual named service work with safe fixed attributes; no raw cause or response. Require parent/child and cancellation proof. |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:652:the SDK, accepted public content/discovery and MCP/WebMCP. Prepare DNS/secrets,\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:670:| `apps/api`, `apps/web`, `apps/docs` and their READMEs; `docs/architecture/{package-ownership,effect-services,api-and-sdk,frontend}.md` | Change required | Native API/standard Website/React lifetime in T003/T004, agent adapters in T006. Retire the old docs app in T005 only after replacement/retention proof. Actual local/browser/agent journeys and bundle/import inspection. |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:671:| `packages/docs-content`, `packages/docs-fumadocs`, accepted public MDX/navigation, generated `.source`, `tools/documentation/owner-policy.json`, content architecture | Change required | One accepted publication/discovery owner in T005; exact status records, regenerated representations, source-faithful pages, processed Markdown and OG images. Content/docs/build/browser checks; never hand-edit generated output. |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:672:| Root manifests/lock/runtime, `turbo.json`, TypeScript, `oxlint.config.ts`, `oxfmt.config.ts`, `knip*.json`, `tools/oxlint/**`, language-service config, `tools/quality-workflow/**` and quality workflow | Change required | Exact qualified versions and the complete 0.6