93f4eba54a76b072a5d69fa1d6ff\", \"bytes\": 679}, {\"path\": \"apps/web/src/routes/$.tsx\", \"sha256\": \"2f2383dd9adcaaa64944acebfd867a427aedca46b30d337e76da66ec9a5b8e71\", \"bytes\": 2472}, {\"path\": \"apps/web/src/routes/__root.tsx\", \"sha256\": \"4092bc9020b3a9314599a0a12f55e7dcf8e4155e3ac302af4758234fe27b0dfd\", \"bytes\": 5273}, {\"path\": \"apps/web/src/server.ts\", \"sha256\": \"669da00729f22cd8b00ea1dcc4cf478be21aed11539de3c9f126dc31\nreadingReview {\"reviewer\": \"Fresh independent impeccable_finish_reviewer\", \"disposition\": \"ship\", \"reviewScope\": \"All four validated supplied captures and page/rendering source; reading/navigation extension only\", \"contract\": \"Fresh agent used supplied Impeccable degraded finish-review contract; screenshots/source only, no inherited build history\", \"reportPath\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-website-docs-finish-review.md\", \"reportSha256\": \"2742e01cd53393e748bfa1d9ca74b45b016621bb825dbc3f5898e6c07e07ef35\", \"report\": \"disposition: ship\\nInputs: PRODUCT.md, DESIGN.md, an approved comp, a measured spec/diff and a quality card were not supplied; the brief makes these unnecessary for this bounded extension of the existing site. The test file was sampled. Review used the supplied degraded review contract, screenshots and source only.\\n\\n## persistence\\nPass within the supplied scope. The route, shared document components, page view, styles and browser checks contain the rendering and navigation work. The brief retains the existing visual system and explicitly rules out new PRODUCT.md or DESIGN.md files. No new visual world, comp round or concept roll was required. All four required captures exist, show the document top, match their named page and width, and contain no blank or broken regions.\\n\\n## fidelity\\n| Element or promise | Result | Evidence |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| TYPE | match | Inter/system text, clear heading sizes, comfortable body spacing and monospace used for code. This follows the retained type direction. |\\n| MATERIAL | match | Plain document surfaces, restrained borders and a genuine geometric diagram. No imitation physical material or invented asset requirement. |\\n| GROUND | match | The source specifies pale #f8fafc, dark #172033 and blue article links; the captures show that field and contrast. |\\n| Purpose | match | The document itself leads: actual title, introduction, instructions and links. |\\n| Existing visual system | match | The accepted pale, quiet documentation style is retained across both pages and widths. |\\n| Reading order | match | Navigation precedes the article; headings, code and next steps remain in the authored order. |\\n| First viewport | match | Both captured phone and desktop views expose the document title and useful opening copy. |\\n| Page form and navigation | match | The article has a 72ch maximum width, a desktop sidebar and a native phone disclosure. The current page is distinguished. Focus treatment is clearly visible. |\\n| Diagram and table on phone | adaptation | Diagram lettering becomes too small to read on the phone. The readable table directly below preserves the same decisions and destinations. Its labelled scroll region keeps all columns accessible without widening the page, as allowed by the supplied phone-access evidence. |\\n| Truth and scope | match | No added commercial claims, synthetic examples or new decorative images were found. The review covers page rendering and navigation only; it does not claim that search, discovery, share images, metrics or old-app retirement are complete. |\\n\\n## ceiling\\nReached for the supplied Read-mode extension. Clear type, useful spacing, ordinary links, controlled line length\ndesignDocumentation {\"reviewer\": \"Fresh independent impeccable_documenter\", \"outcome\": \"Ordinary incumbent-system extension; no new design guide required\", \"reportPath\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-website-docs-design-documentation.md\", \"reportSha256\": \"df7b84de88e3974e2831e22c010d230040c43b2770a771c9746a5237f1d089b8\", \"report\": \"# DEV-76 / CSF-T005 design documentation check\\n\\nDate: 7 October 2026. Mode: Read. Outcome: preserve the existing design.\\n\\nOnly this temporary report was written. No repository file, design guide,\\nprovider or public site was changed by this pass.\\n\\nThe new documentation pages extend the existing Website. The stylesheet at\\nHEAD and the working stylesheet have the same original 184 lines; the diff\\nonly adds document styles. The background, main text, font stack, top\\nnavigation, form styles and keyboard focus colour remain as they were.\\n\\n## Five-line system summary\\n\\n1. Palette: pale background (#f8fafc), dark text (#172033), quieter navigation text (#526071), light borders (#d6dde7), inherited blue focus (#2563eb), and document links in darker blue (#075985).\\n2. Type: the existing Inter/system font stack; article text (1.0625rem, line height 1.75); page title (clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem), line height 1.15); navigation and tables (0.9375rem); code blocks (0.875rem, line height 1.6).\\n3. Layout: article width capped at 72ch, meaning about 72 characters per line; a 17rem desktop sidebar; one column below 52rem; a native collapsible navigation list on phones.\\n4. Surfaces: plain background, thin borders, rounded code blocks (0.375rem), locally scrolling code and tables, and no added shadows or decorative imagery.\\n5. Named rules: no existing named visual rules were found and none were invented; preserve authored reading order, ordinary links, clear current-page marking and visible keyboard focus.\\n\\n## Evidence checked\\n\\nRepository root: `<repository-root>`.\\nBase HEAD: `049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e`.\\nThe checked artifact includes uncommitted work; HEAD alone does not identify it.\\n\\nThe operating instructions read were:\\n\\n- `<installed-impeccable-skill>/reference/document.md`, in full.\\n- `<installed-impeccable-skill>/agents/impeccable_documenter.toml`.\\n- `<installed-impeccable-skill>/reference/degraded/documenter.md` for comparison with the shipped role. This pass used the actual delegated documenter role; no inline substitution was needed.\\n- The supplied repository `AGENTS.md` instructions, `docs/README.md`, `docs/architecture/frontend.md`, and the repository-local docs-maintainer skill, profile and its document-class, change-impact and proof references.\\n- Current documentation-route notes in `apps/web/README.md`, `docs/architecture/content-and-posts.md` and the active clean-slate plan.\\n\\nThe product source sampled was:\\n\\n| Source | SHA-256 at this pass | Observation |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| `apps/web/src/styles.css` | `79c3834a0e88ff1a45a3cbfffef7fec11d740526e60c477d9a2334667e52eb83` | Compared with `git show HEAD:apps/web/src/styles.css` and its actual diff. All original rules are preserved; document rules are appended. |\\n| `apps/web/src/routes/$.tsx` | `3dd5b7088e0052b7976d5c671ba1ee3a9b38cfbe853cc0f8bc6f73265960861\nfullQualification {\"status\": \"Passed\", \"checks\": [{\"stage\": \"format\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"format\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.57, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-website-docs-full-c-format.log\"}, {\"stage\": \"all-tests\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"test\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 83.25, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-website-docs-full-c-all-tests.log\"}, {\"stage\": \"verification\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"verification\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 649.13, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-website-docs-full-c-verification.log\"}, {\"stage\": \"compiled-node\", \"command\": [\"node\", \"/private/tmp/dev76-content-rpc-compiled-node-probe.mjs\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.22, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-website-docs-full-c-compiled-node.log\"}], \"sourceIdentities\": [{\"path\": \"apps/web/README.md\", \"sha256\": \"e1ac0564757f7d5de818a04d8ff31aad0335695525d593e50ec3f785d3c5d794\", \"bytes\": 21315}, 