{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T17:40:38.297Z","ordinal":49526,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1124d-9b19-7913-991c-19ec1db87042","author":"/root/impeccable_search_reviewer","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/impeccable_search_reviewer\nPayload:\ndisposition: ship\n\nSupplied-contract review; no preset was loaded. Whole-new-design artefacts are N/A under the supplied brief. Unread: remaining native test source and full test-run logs.\n\n## persistence\n\nPass for this bounded extension. Both full-page PNGs are valid, show the document top and contain the Quickstart query with five results: desktop 1280 × 1114; phone 390 × 1770.\n\nHEAD matches b7cbed17a0b52283b5f9f75abf68c448d73af390. Local search changes are present. Images establish appearance only; functional success, deployment and availability were not independently checked.\n\nFull review: [dev76-search-finish-review.md](/private/tmp/dev76-search-finish-review.md)\n\nSHA-256: `bd8e560cc5a51afa580309981678144b8469c6c0082588f504d6c8b5dc827dc2`\n\n## fidelity\n\n| Element | Finding | Evidence |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| TYPE | match | Inherited Inter/system type and clear heading sizes remain consistent. |\n| MATERIAL | match | Plain text, native controls and thin rules retain the document design. |\n| GROUND | match | Both images sample #f8fafc. Body, quiet text and links have sufficient contrast. |\n| THESIS | match | The heading, labelled form and linked results make documentation easy to find. |\n| STORY | match | Navigation, heading, form, count and results follow the supplied order. |\n| FIRST VIEWPORT | match | Desktop and phone show the heading, input and button within their first screen. |\n| FORM | match | Source retains a labelled GET form and readonly title/description results. No raw Markdown fragments appear. |\n| Phone layout | adaptation | The button sits below the input; bounded navigation and native disclosure follow the supplied brief. |\n| Results and states | match | Five separated links match the count. Source provides distinct recovery and empty-state guidance; those states were not visually captured. |\n| Focus and floor | match | Phone input focus is clearly visible. No kicker, decorative shadow, gradient text or repeated card scaffold appears. |\n\n## ceiling\n\nReached for this ordinary document extension. Clear type, restrained rules, links and native controls fulfil the incumbent design. Metrics, other T005 work and external availability sit outside this review.\n\n## material_fixes\n\nNone.\n\n## keep\n\nKeep the pale document field, clear title/description links, labelled native GET form, visible focus and bounded phone navigation."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791308438.297863}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1045}}
