duct-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:516:        \"Generate useful deterministic 1200x630 page OG images from checked public page metadata with the selected current Takumi/font graph; never incorporate calculation values.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:519:        \"Apply Q13: processed Markdown exposes only accepted public pages/reference content. Personal report downloads are outside this release; calculation answers remain temporary and visible on screen or through the agreed agent tools. Any public-content cache uses an owned readonly structured key with installed Equal/Hash semantics, not JSON; prove equivalent reconstructed keys, distinct address fields and last-reader cancellation cleanup where a shared cache is needed.\"\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:525:        \"apps/web HTML/docs presentation, generated static discovery/image assets and old-route redirect map\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:526:        \"apps/api dynamic page/navigation/search/processed-Markdown/image services and packages/api/http checked contracts/clients; owning content package preserves prose, links, tables and examples\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:542:        \"Verify public docs/navigation, search, Markdown negotiation/explicit links, crawler-readable rendering, canonicals and share previews on actual local routes.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:543:        \"Check draft exclusion, no raw JSX/imports in processed Markdown, valid image output/size/cache, mobile/keyboard behaviour and old useful URL redirects.\"\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:560:        \"Finished pages are explicitly accepted, unfinished pages do not enter public discovery, and valid public content retains source attribution.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:589:        \"CSF-T005\"\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:593:        \"Add native Effect remote MCP for catalogue/docs discovery, checked calculator inputs, execution and results, reusing the same named operations and accepted Markdown.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:594:        \"Select and qualify native Effect v2026_07_28 stateless and v2025_11_25 stateful adapters before advertising them. Apply anonymous request limits, allowed origins, bounded request/stream lifetimes, cancellation, typed errors and safe tool descriptions; publish discovery and setup docs.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:601:        \"Public agent setup/Markdown docs, app/package READMEs, owning architecture and critical-journey updates\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:649:        \"CSF-T005\"\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:705:        \"CSF-T005\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:844:        \"Update current journey inventory for each calculator path, docs/discovery, SDK consumer, remote/browser agents and analytics/telemetry privacy. Obtain one fresh independent review and reconcile material findings.\",\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:42:- search engine and answer engine discovery, page metadata, social share images\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:43:  and processed Markdown;\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:86:dynamic search, Markdown, content or images -> native API -> owning content/image service\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:87:generated sitemap/robots/agent indexes/static Markdown/OG -> accepted catalogue assets\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:212:| Documentation launch | Agreed in Q6: review and publish finished pages | Update and review pages; publish accepted pages and keep unfinished drafts out of public search | Publication records, search, sitemap, Markdown and agent indexes |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:213:| Public website and API addresses | Agreed in Q7: taxkit.dev, API subdomain and Alchemy-managed DNS/domain | Use taxkit.dev and api.taxkit.dev; follow the Common Practice ownership pattern | Canonical links, origins, sitemap, DNS and deployment routing |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:220:| Markdown scope | Agreed in Q13 | Accepted public docs and calculator reference pages only | Discovery/content representations; no personal report downloads in this release |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:269:| CSF-006 | Publish one useful content and discovery catalogue | Review existing pages, record exact acceptance for finished content and navigation, and keep unfinished drafts out of public search. Derive SEO/AEO metadata, canonicals, sitemap, robots, structured data, search, agent indexes, processed Markdown and page OG images from the same accepted catalogue. Markdown covers public pages/reference content only; no personal report download. Website owns HTML and browser-safe compiled presentation exports; dynamic source/search/Markdown/image services belong to the backend. Generated static assets need no extra server. No raw MDX or alternate calculations. |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:652:the SDK, accepted public content/discovery and MCP/WebMCP. Prepare DNS/secrets,\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:670:| `apps/api`, `apps/web`, `apps/docs` and their READMEs; `docs/architecture/{package-ownership,effect-services,api-and-sdk,frontend}.md` | Change required | Native API/standard Website/React lifetime in T003/T004, agent adapters in T006. Retire the old docs app in T005 only after replacement/retention proof. Actual local/browser/agent journeys and bundle/import inspection. |\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:671:| `packages/docs-content`, `packages/docs-fumadocs`, accepted public MDX/navigation, generated `.source`, `tools/documentation/owner-policy.json`, content architecture | Change required | One accepted publication/di