{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T18:41:46.376Z","ordinal":50643,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-a3b16670-5b43-4d48-8681-a361d8f14d68","process_id":"96299","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n 'Markdown|markdown|Takumi|share image|llms|sitemap' docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md | head -65; sed -n '1,130p' apps/docs/src/routes/\\[.\\$\\].ts 2>/dev/null; rg --files apps/docs/src | rg 'llms|markdown|sitemap|robots|og|share'; sed -n '1,130p' packages/scripts/src/release-check.runtime.ts 2>/dev/null; rg -n 'release:check|packed|validate:downstream' packages/scripts/package.json .agents/skills/package-structure/references/repository-profile.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"rg -n 'Markdown|markdown|Takumi|share image|llms|sitemap' docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md | head -65; sed -n '1,130p' apps/docs/src/routes/\\[.\\$\\].ts 2>/dev/null; rg --files apps/docs/src | rg 'llms|markdown|sitemap|robots|og|share'; sed -n '1,130p' packages/scripts/src/release-check.runtime.ts 2>/dev/null; rg -n 'release:check|packed|validate:downstream' packages/scripts/package.json .agents/skills/package-structure/references/repository-profile.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"42:- search engine and answer engine discovery, page metadata, social share images\n43:  and processed Markdown;\n86:dynamic search, Markdown, content or images -> native API -> owning content/image service\n87:generated sitemap/robots/agent indexes/static Markdown/OG -> accepted catalogue assets\n210:| Calculation privacy | Agreed in Q4: temporary only | No saved calculations, tax figures in URLs, calculation logs or personalised share images | Browser state lifetime and safe operational logging |\n212:| Documentation launch | Agreed in Q6: review and publish finished pages | Update and review pages; publish accepted pages and keep unfinished drafts out of public search | Publication records, search, sitemap, Markdown and agent indexes |\n213:| Public website and API addresses | Agreed in Q7: taxkit.dev, API subdomain and Alchemy-managed DNS/domain | Use taxkit.dev and api.taxkit.dev; follow the Common Practice ownership pattern | Canonical links, origins, sitemap, DNS and deployment routing |\n220:| Markdown scope | Agreed in Q13 | Accepted public docs and calculator reference pages only | Discovery/content representations; no personal report downloads in this release |\n269:| CSF-006 | Publish one useful content and discovery catalogue | Review existing pages, record exact acceptance for finished content and navigation, and keep unfinished drafts out of public search. Derive SEO/AEO metadata, canonicals, sitemap, robots, structured data, search, agent indexes, processed Markdown and page OG images from the same accepted catalogue. Markdown covers public pages/reference content only; no personal report download. Website owns HTML and browser-safe compiled presentation exports; dynamic source/search/Markdown/image services belong to the backend. Generated static assets need no extra server. No raw MDX or alternate calculations. |\n671:| `packages/docs-content`, `packages/docs-fumadocs`, accepted public MDX/navigation, generated `.source`, `tools/documentation/owner-policy.json`, content architecture | Change required | One accepted publication/discovery owner in T005; exact status records, regenerated representations, source-faithful pages, processed Markdown and OG images. Content/docs/build/browser checks; never hand-edit generated output. |\n754:1.435.8, Distilled PostHog/Axiom rc.13 and Takumi 2.14.0. Alchemy beta.80\n907:introduced. Discovery, Markdown negotiation, share images and old-app retirement\n913:The backend content owner projects `/sitemap.xml`, `/robots.txt`, `/llms.txt`\n914:and `/llms-full.txt` from the same accepted catalogue. Application composition\n927:Short agent links use the existing processed-Markdown API endpoint; the full\n933:remains in progress for same-page Markdown negotiation, share images and\npackages/scripts/package.json:42:    \"release:check\": \"bun run src/release-readiness/release-readiness.runtime.ts\",\n.agents/skills/package-structure/references/repository-profile.md:8:- Exceptions: `@taxkit/docs-content` and private `@taxkit/infrastructure` are source-only; `@taxkit/docs-fumadocs` is private compiled; the TypeScript SDK is publishable/dist-only and requires clean publish exports, packed-artifact, and downstream-consumer proof\n.agents/skills/package-structure/references/repository-profile.md:10:- Verification: focused package commands, `bun run test:skills`, and `bun run verification`; for release-facing work run `bun run release:check` (including SDK packed/downstream checks)\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"42:- search engine and answer engine discovery, page metadata, social share images\n43:  and processed Markdown;\n86:dynamic search, Markdown, content or images -> native API -> owning content/image service\n87:generated sitemap/robots/agent indexes/static Markdown/OG -> accepted catalogue assets\n210:| Calculation privacy | Agreed in Q4: temporary only | No saved calculations, tax figures in URLs, calculation logs or personalised share images | Browser state lifetime and safe operational logging |\n212:| Documentation launch | Agreed in Q6: review and publish finished pages | Update and review pages; publish accepted pages and keep unfinished drafts out of public search | Publication records, search, sitemap, Markdown and agent indexes |\n213:| Public website and API addresses | Agreed in Q7: taxkit.dev, API subdomain and Alchemy-managed DNS/domain | Use taxkit.dev and api.taxkit.dev; follow the Common Practice ownership pattern | Canonical links, origins, sitemap, DNS and deployment routing |\n220:| Markdown scop