zen['sourceIdentities']+frozen['preservedSources']['identities']+[frozen['catalogueIdentity']]:assert identity(item['path'])==item,item['path']\ncaptures=json.loads(Path('/private/tmp/dev76-search-reviewed-captures.json').read_text())\nfor item in captures:\n assert identity(item['path'])=={k:item[k] for k in ['path','sha256','bytes']}\n live='.alchemy/native-pair/screenshots/'+Path(item['path']).name\n assert identity(live)['sha256']==item['sha256'],live\nfocus=rows('dev76-search-final-native-d')\nassert all(r['exitCode']==0 for r in focus)\nreview=report('/private/tmp/dev76-search-finish-review.md');assert review['portableReport'].startswith('disposition: ship')\ndesign=report('/private/tmp/dev76-search-design-documentation.md')\nfailed=[]\nfor p in sorted(Path('/private/tmp').glob('dev76-search-*-results.jsonl')):\n for r in [json.loads(line) for line in p.read_text().splitlines()]:\n  if r['exitCode']!=0:failed.append(r)\nv={\n 'schemaVersion':1,'documentType':'bounded-proof-receipt','lifecycle':'evidence','authority':'supporting','owner':'taxkit-web-app-owner','observedAt':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),\n 'status':'Local Website accepted-catalogue search qualified; whole T005 remains in progress','baseHead':frozen['baseHead'],\n 'actorAuthority':{'principal':'Cooper','reviewer':'Codex','operation':'Approved CSF-T005 implementation, local checks, tested commit/push and continuation of draft PR155','environment':'Local native workerd/Chromium pair and repository checks','approvalBoundary':'No merge, deploy, publication, provider apply or metrics implementation'},\n 'outcome':['A labelled /search GET form uses the existing accepted-catalogue searchDocs operation, works without JavaScript and links checked title/description results to documentation.','Literal URL pairs preserve scientific numbers, quoted words, duplicate keys and Unicode; checked ingress rejects unexpected/duplicate keys and overlong words.','Generated native search GET takes no data or client Context, carries only a bounded ASCII URI header and decodes Unicode through the installed Schema codec. Original SSR URLs resist forged headers.','Empty words skip search. Empty/no-match/loading/invalid/unavailable states remain separate; damaged genuine browser replies fail checked restoration safely.','The route restores and matches encoded results before readonly leaf composition. Typed route context avoids server imports in a browser route. Existing heading-focus and phone navigation remain owned.','Local startup observes served-page readiness after printed addresses, retrying only 502/503 for at most fifteen seconds before strict successful browser navigation. The earlier hosted 502 cause remains unknown.'],\n 'impact':{'changeRequired':['apps/web source/Schema/URL/restoration/native-loader/host ingress and existing native/browser tests','Exact oxlint selectors and actual CLI positive/negative cases','apps/web/README.md; frontend, content-and-posts, API-and-SDK, Effect-services and testing-quality architecture','Active SPEC/tasks/plan, existing taxkit-native-website journey and this receipt'],'preserve':['127 hashed sources: 61 accepted pages, 64 review records, navigation and four integration templates; 62 exact bindings and owner policy','Content service and HTTP/RPC contracts; retained calculator answers and Medicare scope decision','Existing visual design and historical docs/runtime receipts','Disabled platform collection and explicit metrics deferral'],'notApplicable':['No package export/wire change or new Changeset; existing documentation contract Changeset retained','No new runbook command, operational procedure, skill installation or provider/credential/release change']},\n 'environment':{'bun':'1.4.2','node':'v24.16.0','effect':'4.0.0','alchemy':'2.0.0-beta.80','reactRouter':'1.170.41','routerCore':'1.171.34','vite':'8.3.2','playwright':'1.63.0','host':'Local macOS arm64; selected Node/Bun and installed Chromium','referenceBoundary':'Earlier Effect and Alchemy upstream references retained; installed Effect URI codec, Alchemy Vite lifecycle and TanStack query/Transitioner source own compatibility. No dependency upgrade.'},\n 'sourceIdentities':frozen['sourceIdentities'],'preservedSources':frozen['preservedSources'],'catalogueIdentity':frozen['catalogueIdentity'],\n 'focusedQualification':{'checks':focus,'observation':'Fresh native build followed by all eleven tests across seven files; focus checks are distinct from the later full repository qualification.'},\n 'fullQualification':{'status':'Passed','checks':full,'sourceIdentities':frozen['sourceIdentities'],'observations':['602 actual lint-rule tests passed inside bun run test','Full verification includes both Knip graphs, owning types/docs/runbooks/paths/workflow checks, SDK and Website browser checks, worker-type check, fresh native build and all native cases','Website browser suite contains 21 cases; the literal-word fixture waits for actual rendered destination words','No changed source bytes after frozen qualification; receipt metadata is excluded from self-referential source hashing and gets separate final tracked-file checks']},\n 'readingReview':{'reviewer':'Fresh independent impeccable_search_reviewer','disposition':'ship','scope':'Both valid supplied desktop/phone captures and sampled search source; search design only','contract':'Fresh no-history agent used supplied Impeccable finish instructions because no preset loader was available',**review},\n 'designDocumentation':{'reviewer':'Fresh independent impeccable_search_documenter','outcome':'Ordinary extension preserves existing system; no repository writes','contract':'Fresh no-history agent used supplied documenter instructions; frozen Git-index source checked during temporary CLI fixtures',**design},\n 'reviewedCaptures':captures,\n 'compiledEntryIdentities':[identity('.alchemy/native-pair/bundles/TaxKitApi/worker.js'),identity('apps/web/dist/server/server.js')],\n 'failedLocalAttempts':failed,\n 'failureCorrections':['The framework default query parser changed 1e3 into 1000; exact literal URL-pair callbacks correct this at the earliest URL owner.','Bare router and immediately resolved navigation did not observe completed React rendering; the fixture mounts actual loader/components in a plain shell and waits for rendered words. Nesting the actual HTML shell in the runner document was invalid and its stalled run was terminated.','Native framework reply uses Seroval representation; plain-JSON substring assertions were corrected, with actual decoded API/browser semantic observations retained.','Full verification found a Bun HTML-rewriter Element.append type clash in the browser fixture. Scoped detached rendering removes unnecessary DOM insertion; focused types, lint and all 21 browser checks pass without a cast, exception or global override.','The new neighbouring encoder canary initially named a nonexistent file although the fixture saves/restores an existing owner. It now exercises the actual router source, followed by all 602 checks passing.'],\n 'hostedObservation':{'candidate':'b7cbed17a0b52283b5f9f75abf68c448d73af390','runId':37500299332,'jobId':112395262171,'url':'https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37500299332','outcome':'Failure: first real CLI Website navigation returned 502 after API health returned 200','underlyingCause':'Unknown; the available hosted excerpt supplies no child-process diagnosis','localResponse':'Bounded served-page readiness for 502/503 only, followed by strict browser navigation; exact final local native tests pass','newCommitHostedProof':'Pending after push; local proof does not reclassify earlier hosted failure'},\n 'rollback':{'local':'Restore this slice to baseHead b7cbed17 with source identities/retained content intact; use a reviewable revert if later changes depend on it','external':'No external runtime mutation to roll back; do not merge or deploy under this authority'},\n 'nonClaims':['Whole DEV-76/T005 is unfinished: discovery, Markdown negotiation, share images and old-app retirement remain.','Metrics remain deferred; no safe exported telemetry, provider cancellation or collection proof.','No new candidate hosted success, deployment, public availability, publication or provider apply.','Images establish appearance only; independent reviewers did not repeat full runtime qualification.','Readiness does not establish the cause or reproduce the earlier hosted 502.'],\n 'nextOwner':'Continue T005 discovery, Markdown negotiation, share images and retirement; keep DEV-76 In Progress and metrics deferred.'}\nreceipt.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\n')\nprint(json.dumps({'receipt':str(receipt),'sources':len(v['sourceIdentities']),'failedLocalChecks':len(failed),'review':'ship','fullQualification':'Passed'}))\neverything else. An accepted packet proves an observation, not authority.\n\n## Procedure\n\n1. Run `bun run check:runbooks`; resolve every exact-target diagnostic before\n   using this procedure.\n2. For an existing immutable attempt, run\n   `RELEASE_ATTEMPT_PATH=<repository-relative-receipt.json> RELEASE_ATTEMPT_SHA256=sha256:<64-hex-digest> bun run release:present`.\n3. Run the focused boundary suite with `bun run test:release-readiness`.\n4. Run the repository graph with `bun run verification`.\n5. To validate only the checked-out CI revision, run `bun run release:check --\n   --ci`. Its nine-check report may be repeated after a material revision or\n   environment change, but cannot be promoted into candidate or release proof.\n   Local runs use local Turbo caching. Do not provide direct `TURBO_TEAM` or\n   `TURBO_TOKEN` values. Trusted GitHub runs get those values only from the\n   fixed `taxkit/ci` Doppler bridge.\n6. Only for an explicitly prepared new candidate, run `bun run release:check`\n   once. Do not rerun merely to improve presentation or conceal a failure.\n7. Preserve the immutable attempt, bounded summary, candidate identity,\n 