passed owning types, lint, content, RPC and API\\nchecks. Actual discovery GET/HEAD and XML/content assertions passed in the native\\njourney, which later found a controlled mismatch fixture had dropped the new\\nContentCatalogue dependency. The fixture's Layer now retains that catalogue\\nwhile substituting only the intended page reply; mismatch assertions stay\\nunchanged. A fresh build and complete native run must qualify this correction.\\n\\nSearch commit `8b32afca` separately passed hosted Quality run `37509022712`,\\njob `112425009444`, completed 6 October at 18:26:09 UTC. The exact head was read\\nback on 7 October. This proves that search commit's hosted checks only; current\\ndiscovery files still need their own qualification and later hosted run.\\n''';p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\\n\\nControlled built page-mismatch fixtures retain ContentCatalogue with\\n`Layer.provideMerge` while replacing only ContentService page replies. Dropping\\nthat dependency causes general RPC unavailability before the intended mismatch\\ncan be observed; the existing exact presentation-error assertion catches this.\\nThe builder must retain the complete service graph rather than weakening that\\nassertion to accept unrelated failure.\\n''';p.write_text(s)\nPY\npython3 /private/tmp/dev75-request-run-checks.py '[[\"format\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"format\"]],[\"types\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"check-types\"]],[\"lint\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"lint\"]],[\"native\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"web:test:native-pair\"]]]' dev76-discovery-focused-h"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('apps/web/scripts/native-pair-build.runtime.ts');s=p.read_text();a='})).pipe(Layer.provide(ApiContentLive))),`';b='})).pipe(Layer.provideMerge(ApiContentLive))),`';assert s.count(a)==1;s=s.replace(a,b);p.write_text(s)\np=Path('apps/web/test/native-pair.boundary.test.ts');s=p.read_text();a='''            expect(yield* Effect.promise(() => head.text())).toBe(\"\");''';b='''            expect(head.headers.get(\"cache-control\")).toBe(\n              served.headers.get(\"cache-control\")\n            );\n            expect(head.headers.get(\"x-content-type-options\")).toBe(\n              served.headers.get(\"x-content-type-options\")\n            );\n            expect(yield* Effect.promise(() => head.text())).toBe(\"\");''';assert s.count(a)==1;s=s.replace(a,b);p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md');s=p.read_text().replace('Their fixed page/search/discovery errors and public-path bounds belong to `@taxkit/content`\\nand are shared with HTTP.','Their fixed page/search/discovery errors and path bounds belong to `@taxkit/content`.\\nPage/search failures and public page paths are shared with HTTP.');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md');s=p.read_text().replace('generated sitemap/robots/agent indexes/static Markdown/OG -> accepted catalogue assets','sitemap/robots/agent indexes -> backend accepted catalogue + checked deferred stage origins\\ngenerated static Markdown/OG -> accepted catalogue assets');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\\n\\nFresh discovery qualification passed owning types, lint, content, RPC and API\\nchecks. Actual discovery GET/HEAD and XML/content assertions passed in the native\\njourney, which later found a controlled mismatch fixture had dropped the new\\nContentCatalogue dependency. The fixture's Layer now retains that catalogue\\nwhile substituting only the intended page reply; mismatch assertions stay\\nunchanged. A fresh build and complete native run must qualify this correction.\\n\\nSearch commit `8b32afca` separately passed hosted Quality run `37509022712`,\\njob `112425009444`, completed 6 October at 18:26:09 UTC. The exact head was read\\nback on 7 October. This proves that search commit's hosted checks only; current\\ndiscovery files still need their own qualification and later hosted run.\\n''';p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\\n\\nControlled built page-mismatch fixtures retain ContentCatalogue with\\n`Layer.provideMerge` while replacing only ContentService page replies. Dropping\\nthat dependency causes general RPC unavailability before the intended mismatch\\ncan be observed; the existing exact presentation-error assertion catches this.\\nThe builder must retain the complete service graph rather than weakening that\\nassertion to accept unrelated failure.\\n''';p.write_text(s)\nPY\npython3 /private/tmp/dev75-request-run-checks.py '[[\"format\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"format\"]],[\"types\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"check-types\"]],[\"lint\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"lint\"]],[\"native\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"web:test:native-pair\"]]]' dev76-discovery-focused-h"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"{\"stage\": \"format\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"format\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.53, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-discovery-focused-h-format.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"types\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"check-types\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 1.26, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-discovery-focused-h-types.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"lint\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"lint\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 6.1, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-discovery-focused-h-lint.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"native\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"web:test:native-pair\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 107.06, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-discovery-focused-h-native.log\"}\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"{\"stage\": \"format\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"format\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.53, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev76-discovery-focused-h-format.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"types\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"