TERIAL / OWN-WORLD | match | Plain text, native form controls and thin rules suit the existing document page. No imitation texture, decorative depth or invented picture is present. |\\n| GROUND / OWN-WORLD | match | Both captures sample #f8fafc at the page field and top corner. The source uses the supplied dark text, quiet text, blue links and blue focus colours. Text contrast against the field is 15.55:1, 6.14:1 and 7.23:1 respectively. |\\n| THESIS | match | The heading identifies documentation search; labelled controls and linked titles make the next step clear. |\\n| STORY | match | Ordinary site links, the existing document navigation, search form, count and results follow the supplied reading order. |\\n| FIRST VIEWPORT | match | Desktop shows the search heading, form and first results immediately. Within the phone's 844-pixel first screen, the heading, input and submit button are visible below the bounded navigation. |\\n| FORM | match | Source retains a labelled GET form and a readonly list of accepted titles and descriptions. The visible copy contains no raw Markdown fragments or added claims. Concept seed requirements are N/A under the settled extension brief. |\\n| Phone reflow | adaptation | The button moves below the input while the existing navigation keeps its bounded scroll region and native disclosure. This follows the supplied phone-navigation and standard-form requirements. No horizontal overflow is visible. |\\n| Results and states | match | Five clearly separated title/description links match the visible count. Sampled source supplies empty, no-match, loading, invalid-input and unavailable guidance. Those additional states were not visually captured in this review. |\\n| Focus and floor | match | The phone capture shows a clear blue input focus ring. Links keep underlines and the source retains heading-focus navigation. No kicker, gradient text, side stripe, repeated card scaffold or decorative shadow appears. The inherited type and browser controls are authorised by the supplied brief. |\\n\\n## ceiling\\n\\nReached for this ordinary document extension. The existing page calls for readable type, restrained rules, clear links and native controls; those are present. A quality card, decorative lettering, ornament, raster assets and authored motion have no authority in this scope. The review covers search design only, with metrics and the rest of T005 outside its decision.\\n\\n## material_fixes\\n\\nNone.\\n\\n## keep\\n\\nKeep the pale document field, clear title/description links, labelled native GET form, visible focus and bounded phone navigation.\\n\\n\"\n1139:    \"portableReport\": \"Supplied-contract role: independent Impeccable documenter using the supplied documenter contract; no preset agent was loaded.\\n\\nWritten: `/private/tmp/dev76-search-design-documentation.md` only. No changes to repository design documentation. This ordinary search extension preserves the existing design; it does not justify creating a design guide or sidecar.\\n\\nSource and system files checked:\\n\\n- Repository: `<repository-root>`; HEAD `b7cbed17a0b52283b5f9f75abf68c448d73af390` matches the supplied frozen-source record.\\n- Product files were read from the Git index, not the temporarily overwritten working files. Every byte count and SHA-256 below matches `/private/tmp/dev76-search-frozen-sources.json`.\\n\\n| Frozen source | Bytes | SHA-256 |\\n| --- | ---: | --- |\\n| `apps/web/src/styles.css` | 6697 | `4945332ea4d0b44401ab0b854181fe5f3d74bd756527f80d52d43637fd052b3c` |\\n| `apps/web/src/routes/search.tsx` | 3113 | `08ba3c26e2cdc5392096a6804dd9da31756f367098da346cefdbcacedbde9bfd` |\\n| `apps/web/src/lib/docs/search.view.tsx` | 2020 | `a9f2cd37c205b2762aaab77c643bb86c52c477abab429e51acad9f238b83600d` |\\n| `apps/web/src/lib/docs/page.view.tsx` | 2276 | `22178bf566c39bb3a5e022e2bf2bb57c5fee5c7ea51fa650c2a2f3d385d84efd` |\\n| `apps/web/src/lib/docs/components.tsx` | 3292 | `85286f6e573ab5e85ab50e7a257445116e8609212f