gree. **N/A** for new design files, token sidecars, public-copy changes, generated references, runbooks, package/release notes, skills and CI changes: this pass changes no product or repository file. Existing proof and task status are preserved; the implementation owner retains responsibility for test and PR receipts. No lifecycle transition or regeneration is needed for this report.\\\\n\\\\nProof limit: source inspection confirms the ordinary GET form and distinct empty, no-match, loading, invalid and unavailable messages. The supplied images confirm appearance only. This pass did not run tests, use a browser, verify deployment or public availability, accept new content, or qualify the rest of T005. The supplied finish review is supporting evidence, not a substitute for independent source reading.\\\\n\\\\nPalette: pale field `#f8fafc`, dark text `#172033`, quiet text `#526071`, rules `#d6dde7`, links `#075985`, focus `#2563eb`; white form controls and `#94a3b8` control borders reuse the existing form colours.\\\\nType: inherited Inter/system stack; article body `1.0625rem` with `1.75` line height, main heading `clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem)` with `1.15`, result titles `1.25rem` with `1.3`, help/navigation `0.9375rem`; labels use weight `600`.\\\\nLayout: desktop `17rem` sidebar beside a reading column capped at `72ch`, inside an `86rem` page; at `52rem` and below the layout becomes one column and navigation stays capped at `16rem`; form controls wrap naturally on the phone.\\\\nComponents: visible \\\\u201cSearch words\\\\u201d label, native search input capped at 100 characters, \\\\u201cSearch documentation\\\\u201d submit button, plain accepted titles linking to existing pages, descriptions and thin result separators; fixed guidance covers the five required states.\\\\nNamed rules: preserve the existing heading-focus rule after ordinary document navigation and the bounded phone-navigation rule; the labelled GET form and readonly accepted result copy follow the settled brief. No new system-wide rule is invented.\\\\n\\\\nDefects/drift not canonised or repaired: no material search drift found in the frozen source and reviewed images; inherited Inter/system type and native browser controls are authorised by the fixed brief, and wider calculator styling is outside this pass.\\\\n\\\"\\n1141:  \\\"reviewedCaptures\\\": [\\n1143:      \\\"path\\\": \\\".alchemy/native-pair/screenshots/reviewed/search/docs-search-desktop.png\\\",\\n1150:      \\\"path\\\": \\\".alchemy/native-pair/screenshots/reviewed/search/docs-search-mobile.png\\\",\\n{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"taxkit-takumi-qualification\\\",\\n  \\\"private\\\": true,\\n  \\\"type\\\": \\\"module\\\",\\n  \\\"dependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@takumi-rs/core\\\": \\\"2.14.0\\\",\\n    \\\"@takumi-rs/wasm\\\": \\\"2.14.0\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n/private/tmp/taxkit-takumi-qualification-20261006-a/probe.mjs\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791312482.394078}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
