es/OpenAPI stay unchanged.','Website GET serves exact checked XML/plain text with UTF-8, nosniff and five-minute public caching. Explicit 200 HEAD keeps headers and has no body. Method/query rejection and expected unavailable binding/settings have empty safe 405/400/503 replies. Unexpected Causes retain existing host reporting.','Sitemap has every accepted canonical page and no invented lastmod. Robots names it and excludes private server functions while permitting the noindex search page to be read. Short agent links use the existing API processed-Markdown endpoint; the full file preserves all accepted bodies and fenced code examples.'],\\n'impact':{'changeRequired':['Content Schemas/origins/errors/service/live/test exports and focused fixtures','Private documentation RPC revision, closed operation, safe handler/client/test composition and complete operation corpus','Native API captured catalogue/deferred configuration and Website named method/host file responses','Built native discovery/XML/content/header/error checks and retained controlled page-mismatch build graph','Owning package/app guides; API/frontend/content/Effect/package/testing architecture; SPEC/task/plan/current journey; two major Changesets; this receipt'],'preserve':['127 source identities: 61 accepted pages, 64 review records, navigation and four templates; 62 acceptance bindings and owner policy','Four public HTTP content routes, generated OpenAPI and public examples','Retained calculator results and Medicare decision; historical immutable evidence; unchanged visual design','Disabled collection and Cooper metrics deferral'],'notApplicable':['No new operational command/procedure/runbook, skills, lint admission, CI control or dependency upgrade','No provider, release, deployment, publication or credential mutation']},\\n'environment':{'bun':'1.4.2','node':'v24.16.0','effect':'4.0.0','alchemy':'2.0.0-beta.80','host':'Local macOS arm64 with selected Node/Bun and installed Chromium','referenceBoundary'